@startuml
title Join synchronization: all, each, quorum, race, reduce
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFCFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #ECF5FC
  BorderColor #477B9B
  StartColor #2F7C5A
  EndColor #7D478F
  ArrowColor #496174
}

state "all" as AllJoin #E9F5EA {
  state "accumulating" as AllAcc #DCEEFF
  [*] --> AllAcc
  state "fired: producer-keyed record" as AllFire #D9EFDF
  AllAcc --> AllAcc : arrival [<latex>|\mathrm{dom}\,j| < |P_n|</latex>]
  AllAcc --> AllFire : arrival [<latex>|\mathrm{dom}\,j| = |P_n|</latex>]\n/ state removed: re-arms next epoch
}

state "each" as EachJoin #DCEEFF {
  state "pass-through" as EachPass #DCEEFF
  [*] --> EachPass
  EachPass --> EachPass : every arrival fires once;\nno accumulation, no state
}

state "quorum (late: cancel | discard | error)" as QuorumJoin #FFE0C8 {
  state "accumulating " as QAcc #DCEEFF
  [*] --> QAcc
  state "fired: producer-keyed record " as QFire #D9EFDF
  state "closed" as QClosed #E7DCF5
  QAcc --> QFire : arrival [<latex>|\mathrm{dom}\,j| \ge k</latex>]\n/ join closes
  QFire --> QClosed
  QClosed --> QClosed : late arrival / late policy;\nstate removed once all expected seen
}

state "race (late: cancel | discard | error)" as RaceJoin #FFF0D9 {
  state "open" as ROpen #DCEEFF
  [*] --> ROpen
  state "fired: winner's value" as RFire #D9EFDF
  state "closed " as RClosed #E7DCF5
  ROpen --> RFire : first arrival / join closes
  RFire --> RClosed
  RClosed --> RClosed : late arrival / late policy
}

state "reduce (collect | first | last | max | mergeRecords | min | sum)" as ReduceJoin #E7DCF5 {
  state "folding" as RedAcc #DCEEFF
  [*] --> RedAcc
  state "fired: accumulator" as RedFire #D9EFDF
  RedAcc --> RedAcc : arrival / fold into accumulator\n[until(accumulator) is false]
  RedAcc --> RedFire : arrival [until(accumulator)]\n/ state removed: re-arms next epoch
}

note right of QuorumJoin #EAF7EE
Occupancy is keyed by node and correlation:
<latex>\mathrm{joinKey} = n \,\Vert\, \mathrm{corr}</latex>, where corr is the root
epoch, the arrival's fork epoch for its route group,
or <latex>H(\mathrm{eval}(\mathit{expr}))</latex> for key correlation. The expected
set <latex>P_n</latex> is the node's incoming transition ids; a
duplicate arrival per open epoch is an error. The
merged token is the least-id arrival; all/quorum
deliver a producer-labeled record (duplicate labels
rejected), and the scope's live count collapses by
<latex>|\mathrm{arrivals}| - 1</latex>.
end note
@enduml
